## 문제

## 내 풀이
```java
class Solution {
    public double solution(int[] numbers) {
        int sum = 0;
        double cnt = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < numbers.length; i++) {
            sum += numbers[i];
            cnt++;
        }
        double answer = sum/cnt;
        return answer;
    }
}
```

## 더 나은 풀이
```java
class Solution {
    public double solution(int[] numbers) {
        int sum = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < numbers.length; i++) 
            sum += numbers[i];
        double answer = (double)sum/numbers.length;
        return answer;
    }
}
```

## 더 상위 버전 풀이
```java
import java.util.Arrays;

class Solution {
    public double solution(int[] numbers) {
        return Arrays.stream(numbers).average().orElse(0);
    }
}
```

